+
+1. Rotate all credentials that ever appeared in git history (see README).
+2. Configure a mail provider before production (`SMTP_URL`, `RESEND_API_KEY` or `MAILER_SERVICE_URL`).
+3. Mount a persistent volume for `PERSISTENT_STATE_DIR` (or implement the Postgres backend).
