diff --git a/docs/decisions/0002-backend-direction.md b/docs/decisions/0002-backend-direction.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..efc6c2e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/decisions/0002-backend-direction.md
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# ADR 0002: Backend direction
+
+**Status:** accepted
+
+`server.ts` (Express 5 + `src/server/supabaseStore.ts` + `src/server/persistentStore.ts`) is the live backend.
+
+An alternative Postgres-backed layer (`auth.ts`, `db.ts`, `store.ts`, `validate.ts`) was started but never wired into the server. It is kept as reference in `docs/future/postgres-layer/` and is **not compiled or tested**. If the project moves to it, wire it in behind the same routes, port the tests, and delete the legacy in-memory store.
+
+## Consequences
+
+- Sessions and one-time tokens persist in a local file (`PERSISTENT_STATE_DIR`). Use a persistent volume, or implement the Postgres backend (`supabase/migrations/20261006000001_persistent_state.sql` already defines the tables).
+- No `pg` / `pglite` / `google-auth-library` dependencies are needed by the live server.
